WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.371
Video 14. Day Book ane drill-down.

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:10.792
K dabavo to Day Book khule chhe: aaj ni
taarikh na vouchers, 2 June.

00:00:10.822 --> 00:00:20.026
Particulars ma saame nu ledger dekhay chhe: rokad vechaan
maate Cash. Stock voucher ma item ane quantity.

00:00:20.056 --> 00:00:25.217
Alt+F2 thi period badlay chhe: ahiya, 1 April
thi 2 June.

00:00:25.916 --> 00:00:32.989
Purchase maate, Particulars ma supplier dekhay
chhe. Contra maate, bank dekhay chhe.

00:00:33.019 --> 00:00:37.934
Voucher pasand karo, ane Enter dabavo: voucher
khule chhe.

00:00:38.635 --> 00:00:41.049
Esc thi paachha Day Book ma.

00:00:41.702 --> 00:00:45.885
Darek report upar thi sharu thaay chhe: ahiya,
Balance Sheet.

00:00:45.815 --> 00:00:50.768
Enter thi group khule chhe, pachhi aagal nu
group, pachhi ledger.

00:00:50.698 --> 00:00:54.125
Pachhi mahino, ane chhelle, voucher pote.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:57.492
Esc thi ek ek level paachha javaay chhe.

00:00:57.792 --> 00:01:01.647
Esc, ane B dabavo to Balance Sheet khule chhe.

00:01:02.345 --> 00:01:05.770
Current Assets pasand karo, ane Enter dabavo.

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:10.630
Group khule chhe: bank, rokad, stock ane
debtors.

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:16.034
Sundry Debtors par Enter: je parties paase thi
paisa levaana chhe.

00:01:16.064 --> 00:01:19.577
Sharma Traders par Enter: mahine mahine
balance.

00:01:20.279 --> 00:01:23.334
April par Enter: mahina na vouchers.

00:01:23.604 --> 00:01:27.729
Sales voucher par Enter: invoice 1 khule chhe.

00:01:27.759 --> 00:01:32.092
Esc thi ek ek level paachha, Balance Sheet
sudhi.

00:01:33.242 --> 00:01:39.105
Have pachhi: Trial Balance, Profit & Loss
account, ane Balance Sheet.

